# Keep the repository LF. A Windows copy of this tree once flipped 45 files to
# CRLF, which breaks the shell scripts on the Linux training machine
# ($'': command not found) and turns every line of a file into a diff.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
*.pcap binary
*.mp4 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
